{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112215","id":2964418979,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wsXGj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112215","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112215.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112215.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112215","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112215/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112215/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112215/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/60d20ab038e1c4a341acb8d04e039db986eb1162","number":112215,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Android: Implement Storage Access Framework (SAF) support","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12669\r\nResolves https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112136\r\n\r\nThis PR implements full SAF support:\r\n\r\n- The Android file picker now returns a URI.\r\n- This URI can be used with `FileAccess` to perform standard read/write operations.\r\n- You can also request full access to a directory using `FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_DIR`.\r\n- This would return a `tree URI`, giving you full access to that directory. You can open/create files inside it directly with paths, without reopening the file picker.\r\n- This tree URI should be saved to avoid asking for access to that directory every time. It can be reused across device restarts, as long as the directory isn't renamed, moved, or deleted.\r\n- To work with files inside this directory, use `FileAccess` as usual, but the path should follow the format `treeUri#relative/path/to/file`.\r\n- Finally, you do not need to ask for any file permissions when using this uri method.\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Sample code for testing</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _pick_file() -> void:\r\n\tvar filters = PackedStringArray([\"*/*\"])\r\n\tvar current_directory = OS.get_system_dir(OS.SYSTEM_DIR_DESKTOP)\r\n\tDisplayServer.file_dialog_show(\"title\", current_directory, \"\", false, DisplayServer.FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_FILE, filters, _picker_callback)\r\n\t\r\n\r\nfunc _picker_callback(status: bool, selected_uris: PackedStringArray, _selected_filter_index: int):\r\n\t$Label.text += str(\"Status: \",status,\"\\n\")\r\n\t$Label.text += str(\"Selected Uris: \",selected_uris,\"\\n\\n\")\r\n\t\r\n\tvar path = selected_uris[0]\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.file_exists(path))\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.get_size(path))\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.get_modified_time(path))\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.get_file_as_bytes(path))\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.get_file_as_string(path))\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.get_md5(path))\r\n\tprint(FileAccess.get_sha256(path))\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"---Saving file normally---\")\r\n\tvar f4 = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.WRITE)\r\n\tprint(f4.store_string(\"It seems to be working!\"))\r\n\tf4.close()\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"---Opening file normally---\")\r\n\tvar f1 = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\r\n\tprint(f1.get_as_text())\r\n\tprint(f1.get_buffer(30))\r\n\tprint(f1.get_path())\r\n\tprint(f1.get_path_absolute())\r\n\tf1.seek(5)\r\n\tprint(f1.get_position())\r\n\tf1.close()\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"---Saving file with password---\")\r\n\tvar f2 = FileAccess.open_encrypted_with_pass(path, FileAccess.WRITE, \"password\")\r\n\tprint(f2.store_string(\"Password is \\\"password\\\".\\n\"))\r\n\tprint(f2.store_line(\"This is a new line\"))\r\n\tf2.close()\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"---Opening file with password---\")\r\n\tvar f3 = FileAccess.open_encrypted_with_pass(path, FileAccess.READ, \"password\")\r\n\tprint(f3.get_as_text())\r\n\tprint(f3.get_buffer(5))\r\n\tprint(f3.get_path())\r\n\tprint(f3.get_path_absolute())\r\n\tf3.seek(5)\r\n\tprint(f3.get_position())\r\n\tf3.close()\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _get_document_tree_uri() -> void:\r\n\tvar filters = PackedStringArray([\"*/*\"])\r\n\tvar current_directory = OS.get_system_dir(OS.SYSTEM_DIR_DESKTOP)\r\n\tDisplayServer.file_dialog_show(\"title\", current_directory, \"\", false, DisplayServer.FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_DIR, filters, _picker_callback_directory_tree)\r\n\r\nfunc _picker_callback_directory_tree(_status: bool, selected_uris: PackedStringArray, _selected_filter_index: int):\r\n\tvar directory_tree_uri = selected_uris[0]\r\n\t_picker_callback(true, [str(directory_tree_uri+\"#\"+\"testing_saf.txt\")], 0)\r\n```\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details> \r\n\r\nEdit: To be able to reuse the URI across app restarts, you need to request persistable permission. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113367","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs"